direction: right
classes: {
  error: {
    style: {
      fill: "#fdd"
      stroke: "#c00"
      stroke-width: 2
    }
  }
}
Parse: Valid? {shape: diamond}
Build: Build graph
Fail: Report error {class: error}
pipeline: Conversion pipeline {
  Emit: Emit D2
}
Start -> Parse
Parse -> Build: yes
Parse -> Fail: no
Build -> pipeline.Emit
pipeline.Emit -> Done
